{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Act as an expert Shopify frontend and Liquid developer. Build a fully responsive, pixel-perfect custom split-feature section based entirely on the visual layout, spacing, and copy structure shown in the reference images "image_83e611.jpg" and "image_83e610.jpg".
    
    ### 1. Global Integration, Max Width & Basic Styles
    - **Theme Identity:** The section must automatically inherit the current theme's typography variables (e.g., `var(--font-heading-family)` and `var(--font-body-family)`), standard layout maximum width rules (e.g., matching your storefront's `.page-width` or `.container` layout wrappers), and native responsive side padding.
    - **Section Layout:** On desktop screens, the section displays a balanced 2-column layout (Left Column: Bold Copy & Description; Right Column: Mock UI Interface Card Container). On mobile viewports, the layout must stack vertically with the right column sliding cleanly underneath the left column.
    - **Section Background:** Pure white background (#FFFFFF) with comfortable top and bottom padding.
    
    ### 2. Left Column Layout (Text Copy Block)
    - **Top Badge Content:** A small, pill-shaped badge displaying the text "FLOW AI". 
      - Background: A very light, soft pastel lime-green background wash.
      - Text Color: A distinct olive/lime green accent color.
      - Border-Radius: 20px.
    - **Main Heading:** "店舗データと社内ルールを、\nFlow AIに聞く。" 
      - Formatting: Large, bold, deep navy blue text with a distinct line break as shown in the image to maintain editorial structure.
    - **Body Text Paragraph:** A smaller paragraph positioned below the heading using a muted slate-gray or dark-navy text color with proper line-height to ensure the Japanese text is highly legible:
      "Flow AIは、売上・来店・購買率などの店舗データと、\nマニュアル・SOP・店舗報告を参照しながら、\n状況確認、要因整理、次の打ち手の検討を支援します。"
    
    ### 3. Right Column Layout (Mock UI Feature Card)
    The right element is contained within a large white multi-layered interface block designed to look like a clean interactive card window.
    - **Parent Card Styling:** 
      - Background: Ultra-soft, off-white or light gray background card wash.
      - Border: A very thin, light gray outer stroke.
      - Shape: Rounded corners (border-radius: 16px).
      - Spacing: Substantial internal padding to isolate the inner chat blocks.
    
    - **Card Header Group:** Features a horizontal flex layout containing:
      - A subtle 4-point sparkle line-art SVG icon in an accent green color.
      - A vertical text cluster: Title text reading "Flow AI" (Bold, prominent, dark navy) and smaller description text reading "店舗運営について質問できます" (Muted gray text).
    
    - **Inner Chat Block Rows:** A vertical stack of 3 individual message containers. Each container must be a separate card row with a pure white background, smooth rounded corners (border-radius: 12px), an ultra-faint gray border, and embedded flex items:
      - **Left Asset:** A small, rounded light gray or green-outlined container housing a custom line-art SVG icon matching the context (Data Bar Chart icon for row 1, Search/Magnifying Glass icon for row 2, Target/Gear circle icon for row 3).
      - **Right Content:** A vertical text grouping containing an olive-green label and bold dark-navy quote copy exactly as follows:
        - **Row 1 Label:** 状況を聞く  |  **Row 1 Quote:** 「今日、売上目標に届くために何を優先すべきですか？」
        - **Row 2 Label:** 理由を聞く  |  **Row 2 Quote:** 「来店数はあるのに購買率が低い理由は何ですか？」
        - **Row 3 Label:** 次の打ち手を聞く  |  **Row 3 Quote:** 「接客・VMD・スタッフ配置のどこを見直すべきですか？」
    
    - **Card Footer Tag List:** A thin divider separator or spacing block followed by a bottom horizontal flex wrap section containing:
      - **Label:** An inline database icon followed by text reading "参照データ" (Dark navy/black text).
      - **Pill Tags System:** A row of light gray pill blocks with soft rounded corners, light gray background fills, and tiny crisp black font text: "売上", "来店", "購買率", "Pulse", "SOP", "メモ", and a trailing multi-dot option icon button ("...").
    
    ### 4. Liquid Schema & Custom CSS Requirements
    - Make all titles, content, badge text, and the row quotes completely editable by mapping them to appropriate text, textarea, and block loops inside the section schema settings.
    - All custom CSS styles must be tightly scoped using the `#shopify-section-{{ section.id }}` handle to guarantee absolutely zero layout or style leaking across your theme.
    - Ensure the right interface card scales cleanly down on tablet or mobile dimensions without any inner text overflowing or cutting off.
    
    
    Make sure the icons are selectable with our default icon selections like other sections, also the style, witdh , backgroun dcolor should be editable
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature {
    display: block;
    background-color: {{ section.settings.section_background }};
    padding: {{ section.settings.section_padding_top }}px 0 {{ section.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-container {
    max-width: {{ settings.page_width | default: 1200 }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1000px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: {{ section.settings.column_gap }}px;
    }
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-left {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 6px 16px;
    background-color: {{ section.settings.badge_background }};
    color: {{ section.settings.badge_text_color }};
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    width: fit-content;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-badge-icon {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-badge-icon svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    stroke: currentColor;
    fill: none;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-right {
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-card {
    background-color: {{ section.settings.card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ section.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ section.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: {{ section.settings.card_padding }}px;
    width: {{ section.settings.card_width }}%;
    max-width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-card-icon {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: {{ section.settings.card_icon_color }};
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-card-icon svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    stroke: currentColor;
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-card-header-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-card-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family, sans-serif);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ section.settings.card_title_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-card-subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family, sans-serif);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: {{ section.settings.card_subtitle_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-chat-rows {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-chat-row {
    background-color: {{ section.settings.row_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ section.settings.row_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ section.settings.row_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 16px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-chat-icon-wrapper {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    background-color: {{ section.settings.row_icon_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ section.settings.row_icon_border_color }};
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: {{ section.settings.row_icon_color }};
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-chat-icon-wrapper svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    stroke: currentColor;
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-chat-content {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-chat-label {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family, sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ section.settings.row_label_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-chat-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family, sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: {{ section.settings.row_quote_color }};
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
    white-space: pre-line;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family, sans-serif);
    color: {{ section.settings.heading_color }};
    white-space: pre-line;
    margin: 0;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-description {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family, sans-serif);
    color: {{ section.settings.description_color }};
    white-space: pre-line;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-divider {
    height: 1px;
    background-color: {{ section.settings.divider_color }};
    margin: 16px 0;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-footer {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-footer-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-body-family, sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ section.settings.footer_label_color }};
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-footer-icon {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-footer-icon svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    stroke: currentColor;
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-tag {
    background-color: {{ section.settings.tag_background }};
    color: {{ section.settings.tag_text_color }};
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    font-family: var(--font-body-family, sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-tag-more {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: {{ section.settings.tag_background }};
    border-radius: 50%;
    cursor: pointer;
    color: {{ section.settings.tag_text_color }};
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-tag-more svg {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    fill: currentColor;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 999px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-split-feature-card {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-split-feature">
  <div class="ai-split-feature-container">
    <div class="ai-split-feature-grid">
      <!-- Left Column -->
      <div class="ai-split-feature-left">
        {% if section.settings.show_badge %}
          <div class="ai-split-feature-badge">
            {% if section.settings.badge_icon != 'none' %}
              <span class="ai-split-feature-badge-icon">
                {% case section.settings.badge_icon %}
                  {% when 'sparkles' %}
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                      <path d="M12 3l1.912 5.813a2 2 0 001.275 1.275L21 12l-5.813 1.912a2 2 0 00-1.275 1.275L12 21l-1.912-5.813a2 2 0 00-1.275-1.275L3 12l5.813-1.912a2 2 0 001.275-1.275L12 3z"/>
                    </svg>
                  {% when 'star' %}
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                      <polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/>
                    </svg>
                  {% when 'lightning' %}
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                      <polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/>
                    </svg>
                  {% when 'check' %}
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                      <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
                    </svg>
                {% endcase %}
              </span>
            {% endif %}
            {{ section.settings.badge_text }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if section.settings.heading != blank %}
          <h2 class="ai-split-feature-heading h1">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>
        {% endif %}

        {% if section.settings.description != blank %}
          <p class="ai-split-feature-description">{{ section.settings.description }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column -->
      <div class="ai-split-feature-right">
        <div class="ai-split-feature-card">
          <div class="ai-split-feature-card-header">
            <div class="ai-split-feature-card-icon">
              {% case section.settings.card_header_icon %}
                {% when 'sparkles' %}
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <path d="M12 3l1.912 5.813a2 2 0 001.275 1.275L21 12l-5.813 1.912a2 2 0 00-1.275 1.275L12 21l-1.912-5.813a2 2 0 00-1.275-1.275L3 12l5.813-1.912a2 2 0 001.275-1.275L12 3z"/>
                  </svg>
                {% when 'message' %}
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/>
                  </svg>
                {% when 'brain' %}
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <path d="M9.5 2A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 12 4.5v15a2.5 2.5 0 0 1-4.96.44 2.5 2.5 0 0 1-2.96-3.08 3 3 0 0 1-.34-5.58 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 1.32-4.24 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 1.98-3A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 9.5 2Z"/>
                    <path d="M14.5 2A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 12 4.5v15a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4.96.44 2.5 2.5 0 0 0 2.96-3.08 3 3 0 0 0 .34-5.58 2.5 2.5 0 0 0-1.32-4.24 2.5 2.5 0 0 0-1.98-3A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 14.5 2Z"/>
                  </svg>
                {% when 'cpu' %}
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/>
                    <rect x="9" y="9" width="6" height="6"/>
                    <path d="M15 2v2M15 20v2M2 15h2M20 15h2M2 9h2M20 9h2M9 2v2M9 20v2"/>
                  </svg>
              {% endcase %}
            </div>
            <div class="ai-split-feature-card-header-text">
              <h3 class="ai-split-feature-card-title">{{ section.settings.card_title }}</h3>
              <p class="ai-split-feature-card-subtitle">{{ section.settings.card_subtitle }}</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="ai-split-feature-chat-rows">
            <!-- Row 1 -->
            <div class="ai-split-feature-chat-row">
              <div class="ai-split-feature-chat-icon-wrapper">
                {% case section.settings.row_1_icon %}
                  {% when 'chart' %}
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                      <line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"/>
                    </svg>
                  {% when 'search' %}
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                      <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"/>
                    </svg>
                  {% when 'target' %}
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                      <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/>
                    </svg>
                {% endcase %}
              </div>
              <div class="ai-split-feature-chat-content">
                <p class="ai-split-feature-chat-label">{{ section.settings.row_1_label }}</p>
                <p class="ai-split-feature-chat-quote">{{ section.settings.row_1_quote }}</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Row 2 -->
            <div class="ai-split-feature-chat-row">
              <div class="ai-split-feature-chat-icon-wrapper">
                {% case section.settings.row_2_icon %}
                  {% when 'chart' %}
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                      <line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"/>
                    </svg>
                  {% when 'search' %}
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                      <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"/>
                    </svg>
                  {% when 'target' %}
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                      <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/>
                    </svg>
                {% endcase %}
              </div>
              <div class="ai-split-feature-chat-content">
                <p class="ai-split-feature-chat-label">{{ section.settings.row_2_label }}</p>
                <p class="ai-split-feature-chat-quote">{{ section.settings.row_2_quote }}</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Row 3 -->
            <div class="ai-split-feature-chat-row">
              <div class="ai-split-feature-chat-icon-wrapper">
                {% case section.settings.row_3_icon %}
                  {% when 'chart' %}
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                      <line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"/>
                    </svg>
                  {% when 'search' %}
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                      <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"/>
                    </svg>
                  {% when 'target' %}
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                      <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/>
                    </svg>
                {% endcase %}
              </div>
              <div class="ai-split-feature-chat-content">
                <p class="ai-split-feature-chat-label">{{ section.settings.row_3_label }}</p>
                <p class="ai-split-feature-chat-quote">{{ section.settings.row_3_quote }}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          {% if section.settings.show_footer %}
            <div class="ai-split-feature-divider"></div>

            <div class="ai-split-feature-footer">
              <div class="ai-split-feature-footer-label">
                <span class="ai-split-feature-footer-icon">
                  {% case section.settings.footer_icon %}
                    {% when 'database' %}
                      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"/>
                        <path d="M3 5v14c0 1.66 4 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3V5"/>
                        <path d="M3 12c0 1.66 4 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3"/>
                      </svg>
                    {% when 'folder' %}
                      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="M22 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h5l2 3h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/>
                      </svg>
                    {% when 'file' %}
                      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/>
                        <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
                      </svg>
                  {% endcase %}
                </span>
                {{ section.settings.footer_label }}
              </div>

              <div class="ai-split-feature-tags">
                {% assign tag_list = section.settings.footer_tags | split: ',' %}
                {% for tag in tag_list %}
                  <span class="ai-split-feature-tag">{{ tag | strip }}</span>
                {% endfor %}
                {% if section.settings.show_more_button %}
                  <button class="ai-split-feature-tag-more" aria-label="More options">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                      <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.5"/>
                      <circle cx="19" cy="12" r="1.5"/>
                      <circle cx="5" cy="12" r="1.5"/>
                    </svg>
                  </button>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Split Feature AI",
  "tag": "section",
